  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Connect is a regional pilot activity under the people-to-people pillar of Australia&apos;s stepped-up engagement with the Pacific, as set out in the 2017 Foreign Policy White Paper.  The program aims to forge stronger, strategic-level relationships between Pacific and Australian leaders across government, business and community groups.</narrative>
